Error [E0764]: `make` has no parameter labelled `depth`
  --> tests/ui/label_unknown.jet:10:42
    |
 10 | fn run() { _ :: Container.make(width: 5, depth: 3) }
    |                                          ^^^^^
 Why: a label binds an argument to the parameter of that name
 Fix: `make` accepts `width`, `height`
